WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,202
grandparents

2
00:00:01,202 --> 00:00:03,306
Now that Yoyo is back

3
00:00:03,306 --> 00:00:05,711
Then send me away

4
00:00:05,711 --> 00:00:08,717
I also gave birth to my mother

5
00:00:08,717 --> 00:00:10,220
I'm looking for...

6
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,960
Jiaojiao, you will always be grandma’s precious granddaughter

7
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:17,660
At that time, Erxi Lingpen was hunted by his enemies, and he and his son both fell into the sea and disappeared. Their life and death are unknown.

8
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:23,660
Although the child left behind by the two was secretly replaced by Jiaojiao, Jiaojiao's biological father was a gambler, and her biological mother died of hemorrhage after childbirth.

9
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:28,060
There is also a family with a younger brother who knows cannibalism. How could I be willing to send Xiao Fuxin back?

10
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:29,976
No

11
00:00:29,976 --> 00:00:30,854
Come again

12
00:00:30,854 --> 00:00:34,803
The workload will increase even more

13
00:00:34,803 --> 00:00:40,068
What kind of delicacies does my sister want to eat?

14
00:00:40,068 --> 00:00:42,700
She can satisfy her

15
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:48,800
I am a useless person now. If something happens to my family, I can only take my sister to the street to beg for food.

16
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:56,000
Is it too late to learn any talent now?

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,620
Grandpa, what did you say? Send Youyou to grandma’s house

18
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,268
This is just a stopgap measure

19
00:01:01,268 --> 00:01:02,916
Now I am in a coquettish mood

20
00:01:02,916 --> 00:01:06,683
Are you just going to let me go and ignore you, the eldest brother?

21
00:01:06,683 --> 00:01:07,860
How can you bear it?

22
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:10,660
Sooner or later she has to accept reality

23
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:12,100
she is still a child

24
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:14,020
Not an employee of your company

25
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:16,180
You kid, don't let me keep my pen from now on.

26
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:19,060
She is your sister just like Yoyo

27
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:22,650
Did you hear that? I don’t agree.

28
00:01:22,650 --> 00:01:23,553
old lady

29
00:01:23,553 --> 00:01:26,865
Yesterday was fine and I was interested in Mafengwo

30
00:01:26,865 --> 00:01:29,273
A person ran out to observe

31
00:01:29,273 --> 00:01:31,381
Looks like he was bitten by a wasp

32
00:01:31,381 --> 00:01:34,090
Fortunately, Qianjin came to the rescue

33
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:36,520
It's okay, brother. It's okay.

34
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:41,980
Oh my God, wasps are poisonous. How dangerous they are.

35
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:44,840
Jiaojiao, luckily you're fine
